@format 1
@id media-loading.in-funnel-tab
@title In Funnel tab
@section Media loading
@area In Funnel tab
@entry funnel-path-change, funnel-drain
@summary Show Funnel-specific selected-path loading and the conditional post-relay source drain, which runs only when Relay Empty is enabled and at least one file was successfully relayed.
@related media-loading.common.files-selection, media-loading.common.viewer-gate, media-loading.common.docket-removal
@tag media
@tag loading
@tag funnel

@alias funnel = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PFunnelTab
@alias messenger = Cadroue.ShellEngine.LMessenger
@alias app = Cadroue.UIShell.PProgram

[funnel-path-change] Funnel Files current-path event <input>
= PListPathChange delivered the current path to PFunnelPathShow.
> funnel-path-result

[funnel-drain] Funnel relay handling <input>
- For each Funnel item, add its source path to the relayed-path set only when a filename rule resolves a nonempty target and LMessengerFunnelDeliverSource reports successful delivery @ messenger.LMessengerFunnelDescribe(...)
> drain-gate

[funnel-path-result] Funnel selected-path adapter <decision>
- Ignore a blank path; otherwise request it from the Funnel viewer @ funnel.PFunnelPathShow(...)
? "Nonblank current path" > map:media-loading.common.viewer-gate
? "Blank current path" > funnel-no-request

[drain-gate] Post-relay source-drain conditions <decision>
- Invoke the Funnel drain seam only when Relay Empty is enabled and the relayed-path set contains at least one successfully delivered source @ messenger.LMessengerFunnelDescribe(...)
? "Relay Empty enabled and relayed set nonempty" > drain-source
? "Relay Empty disabled or no successful relay" > funnel-retained

[funnel-no-request] Funnel viewer request omitted <output>
= Funnel does not call the shared viewer-loading pipeline.

[drain-source] Invoke configured Funnel drain <process>
- Pass only successfully relayed source paths to LMessengerFunnelDrainSource @ messenger.LMessengerFunnelDescribe(...)
- The startup-configured UI seam removes those paths from the currently selected tab's Files docket when that tab still exposes one @ app.OnStartup(...)
> map:media-loading.common.docket-removal

[funnel-retained] Funnel source Files retained <output>
= No source-drain seam is invoked when Relay Empty is disabled or when every Funnel item failed/skipped delivery.
